---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /australia/blog/
title: "Australia Personal Finance Blog 2026 — CalcPhi"
description: "Expert guides on superannuation, home loans, tax, investing and retirement for Australians. Real numbers and ATO-accurate advice — no jargon, no fluff."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: Home
    url: /
  - name: Australia
    url: /australia/
  - name: Blog
---

<main id="main-content">
  <div class="hub-hero">
    <div class="hub-hero__inner">
      <h1>Australia Personal Finance Blog</h1>
      <p>Plain-English guides to help Australians make smarter financial decisions — covering super, home loans, tax, investing and retirement. Written by CFAs, CPAs, and CFPs with Australian-specific context.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hub-content">
    <div class="blog-grid">

      {% for post in collections.auBlog %}
        {% set slug = post.url | replace("/australia/blog/", "") | replace("/", "") %}
        {% set meta = australia.blogMeta[slug] %}
        {% if meta %}
        <article class="blog-card">
          <div class="blog-card__meta">
            <span class="blog-card__tag">{{ meta.category }}</span>
            <span class="blog-card__date">{{ post.data.datePublished | monthYear }}</span>
            {% if post.data.dateModified and post.data.dateModified != post.data.datePublished %}
            <span class="blog-card__updated">Updated {{ post.data.dateModified | monthYear }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ meta.cardTitle }}</a></h2>
          <p>{{ meta.cardSummary }}</p>
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-card__read">Read article →</a>
        </article>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}

    </div>
  </div>
</main>
